## Boundaries

- {{What belongs here.}}
- No code checkouts, credentials, `.env` files, tokens, or OS metadata in this tree. Checkouts live in the machine-local checkouts root and are referenced by binding token.
- Never store member-specific harness state here (`settings.local.json`, `*.code-workspace`); keep it in user scope, and launch sessions from a machine-local primary folder.
- {{Any material that needs review before sharing. Ask before moving or summarizing it.}}
- Nearest, most-specific `AGENTS.md` wins locally, unless it conflicts with this boundary.

## Layout

- `product-work/` — shared work the team relies on. One folder per area; each declares one profile. `area-manifest.yaml` registers areas and exceptions.
- `prototyping/` — spikes, mockups, experiments. No assigned profile.
- `agentic-support/` — the support engine: skills, Context Fabric, tools, validation.

